# Environment variables for local development and deployment.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in values. Never commit .env.local.

# ── Voice Agent demo (ElevenLabs Conversational AI) ──────────────────────────
# Required for the live browser demo on /voice-agent.
# Create an agent in the ElevenLabs dashboard, then paste:
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID=

# Without both values, the page and API show "Demo currently unavailable"
# and never simulate a successful connection.
